Article 70

(1) The City Government is obliged to conduct guidance and supervision of the implementation of Women's empowerment and protection of Child victims of Violence.

(2) Guidance as referred to in paragraph (1), includes:

a. guidelines and fulfillment standards;

b. technical guidance and training;

c. provision of facilities;

d. monitoring; and

e. evaluation.

(3) Guidance as referred to in paragraph (2) is in order to realize the objectives of empowerment and Protection of women and Child victims of Violence in accordance with minimum service standards.
